      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I couldn't really say but it may be that your floor is literally tilted in Steam VR. I have had an issue with slight tilt here and there especially when I lose tracking but the way your describing it makes it seem a lot like something to do with your playspace or hardware. You could try using 1 then 2 then 3 base stations and see if it changes, and I also would suggest when you calibrate the floor the left controller determines height but I believe the right one determines level (MAYBE) so try separating them a bit more and then calibrate the floor.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
