      "value": "@{6962aefff85d59c66dea9af8|full_name} I had a look at this. As mentioned before this has persisted across several different playspaces in my physical home, so I had my doubts. Resetting my playspace from scratch with some base stations on or off made no difference.\n\nTo be extra sure, I ended up checking in other games too (BONELAB, Skyrim VR, Blade & Sorcery, ChiloutVR). The issue is exclusive to VRChat and does't happen in any other VR titles.",
